  "description": "With advanced 3D laser scanning tech, the OEDRO front & back seat floor liner set is compatible with the 2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body crew cab (NOT for Classic models) with under-seat storage.\nFeatures\nLess slippery. High-walled design helps contain messes of any kind. Anti-skid nibs and underside texture keep FloorLiner HP in place.\nTPE material. TPE is a Thermoplastic Elastomer, Combines the advantages of rubber and plastic materials, so it has good resilience, durability, and flexibility.\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with strong rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. Honda floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. Adding an all-weather floor liner to your car’s interior will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\n2-years warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab New Body Models.\nONLY Compatible with 1st Row Bucket Seats, 2nd Row Factory Storage Box (NOT for Classic Models).",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
